  "processing:lineage": "Sentinel-2 SCL cloud mask; per-band standardisation of Sentinel-2; per-orbit standardisation of Sentinel-1 ascending/descending, then merged; observations binned into fixed-length buckets (8 to 256) with resampling of residual slots",
